  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the beef strips and cook until they are browned.",
    "Add the grated carrots and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic sauce, dashi extract, and salt free seasoning, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the uncooked white rice and stir to combine with the beef mixture.",
    "Add the low sodium beef broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and serve on a hot stone plate."
  ],
